# This repository is a COMPLETE snapshot.
#
# The working repository (aayusharmaaa/tallystick) ignores data/, models/,
# artifacts/, and ledger/ because all four are regenerable and large. This one keeps
# them, so a clone is the project exactly as it stood — trained model, every
# generated artifact, and the decision ledger with its hash chain intact.
#
# Only three things are still excluded, and none of them is project state.

# Python build and cache output.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Ground truth rewritten on every run of scripts/verify_browser_model.mjs.
dist-verify/

# Credential material, deliberately never committed.
#
# accounts.db holds argon2id password hashes and live session tokens. Anything
# committed to git is permanent in its history, so credentials do not go in even
# when the repository is private. Nothing is lost by leaving it out: the file is
# created on first run, and `tally user create` makes an account.
ledger/accounts.db
